;\">정도</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2. 일정별 추진계획</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">공고 및 신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: </span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2026. 9. 14.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">) ~ 2026. 9. 30.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">평일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">09</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">~18</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">공휴일 및 평일 점심시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(12~13</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">은 접수 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">선정심의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: 2026. 11</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">월 중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">지원대상자 확정통보 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: 2026. 11</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">월 중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">장학증서 수여식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: 2026. 12. 12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">) 10:30 (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">장학금 지급 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2026. 12</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">월 중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">장학증서 수여식 이후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">3. 신청자격 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">자세한 사항은 선발계획 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">공고일 현재 본인 또는 부모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">친권자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">가 수성구에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">년 이상 거주</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.3pt; font-size: 13pt;\">하고 있는 대구시 소재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">고등학교 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">국내대학 재학생 및 학교 밖 청소년</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 3em; text-indent: -31.6pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. 2025</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">년 수성인재장학생이 아닌 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">모범</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">특기 분야는 재신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 3em; text-indent: -31.6pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -32pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. 2026</span><span style=\"text-indent: -32pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2</span><span style=\"text-indent: -32pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">학기 타 기관의 장학금을 받지 아니한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 17.3333px; letter-spacing: -1.33333px;\">&nbsp;4.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"> 구비서류 및 신청절차 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">선발계획 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;5. 기타사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">모든 제출서류는 공고일 이후 발급분만 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; margin-left: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">장학생 선발자는 장학증서 수여식 참여 필수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;6. 문의처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: <b>(</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">수성미래교육재단 사무국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">053-668-7312)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:190%;margin-left:5.0pt;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">자세한 사항은 반드시 붙임 선발계획을 참조하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:190%;margin-left:5.0pt;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:190%;margin-left:5.0pt;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 2026년 수성인재장학생 선발계획 공고문 1부.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 2026년 수성인재장학생 지원 신청서 등(서식일체) 1부.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
